    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StarDust is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you\u00a0 find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Singularity&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of which have huge detonations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future release will include a campaign mode where you explore, discover and take over nearby inhabitable planets.\u00a0The random planet generator that will be used in campaign mode is currently available to create your own planets in the Planet Generator screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack includes two great pieces of music by Chris Haigh and Ian Dorsch as well as motion-picture quality sound effects.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >StarDust is a game about transgalactic exploration, discovery, battle, and conquest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently only features the single player and multiplayer battle modes, where you\u00a0 find yourself in a three-dimensionally looped &quot;Singularity&quot; in outer space to fight it out for your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons include lasers, dumbfire and homing missiles, some of which have huge detonations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A future release will include a campaign mode where you explore, discover and take over nearby inhabitable planets.\u00a0The random planet generator that will be used in campaign mode is currently available to create your own planets in the Planet Generator screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack includes two great pieces of music by Chris Haigh and Ian Dorsch as well as motion-picture quality sound effects.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Leon Skum's world of advanced technology. In this age, everybody who is anybody has their own Personal Spaceship to fly in. Find weapons, perform missions, conquer enemies.",
